        "title": "Line Breaks, Emphasis and Importance",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 134830,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sometimes we want to format paragraphs with line breaks.</p><p>For example, this song would look much better if <code>Raindrops on roses</code> appeared on one line, <code>Whiskers on kittens</code> on the next, and so on.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;h1&gt;My favorite things&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt; Raindrops on roses Whiskers on kittens Bright copper kettles Warm&#xA; woolen mittens &lt;/p&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Line breaks",
            "id": 134837,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We can separate lines with the help of the <strong>line break tag</strong>: <code>br</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Raindrops on roses\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Whiskers on kittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Bright copper kettles \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Warm woolen mittens\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"106\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We can separate lines with the help of the <strong>line break tag</strong>: <code>br</code>. It stands on its own, so it has no closing tag.</p><p>Make each favorite thing appear on its own line inside the paragraph.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Raindrops on roses\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Whiskers on kittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Bright copper kettles\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Warm woolen mittens\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;p&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/p&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>, and finally <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Empty tags",
            "id": 134831,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>&lt;br&gt;</code> is an <strong>empty tag</strong>. Empty tags have no closing tag and no content. They are also called self-closing tags.</p><p>Put together the line break tag.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Raindrops on roses\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Whiskers on kittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Bright copper kettles\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Warm woolen mittens\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"107\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Emphasis",
            "id": 134812,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>There's an element for giving emphasis to text. It makes it <em>italic</em>. It's called the <code>em</code> element. Add <code>&lt;em&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Raindrops on \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"roses\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Whiskers on kittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Bright copper kettles\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Warm woolen mittens\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"60\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;em&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>There's an element for giving emphasis to text. It makes it italic. It's called the <code>em</code> element.</p><p>Wrap the right word so only roses is emphasized.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Raindrops on \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"roses\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Whiskers on kittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Bright copper kettles\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Warm woolen mittens\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;strong&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/strong&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;br&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;em&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Importance",
            "id": 134813,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To define text as important, we use the <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code> tags. They make text <strong>bold</strong>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Raindrops on \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"roses\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Whiskers on \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"kittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"102\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To define text as important, we use the <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code> tags. They make text bold.</p><p>Now define only kittens as important, and leave roses alone.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My favorite things\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Raindrops on \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"roses\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" Whiskers on \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"kittens\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;em&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/em&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;br&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 134838,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What's the <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> tag for?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\">It gives emphasis to text</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\">It adds a line break</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It adds a line break.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>You put <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> between two words in a paragraph. What's the effect?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The second word drops to a new line</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Both words turn italic</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The two words split into separate paragraphs</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The second word drops to a new line.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 134814,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which of these tags is an empty or self-closing tag?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;br&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;/em&gt;</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;p&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>An empty tag has no closing tag and no content. Which of these is an empty tag?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;br&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;p&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;button&gt;</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;h1&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 134839,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which of these tags give emphasis to text?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;em&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;p&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/p&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&lt;em&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The <code>em</code> element gives text emphasis and makes it italic.</p><p>You wrap one word in a sentence with <code>&lt;em&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>. What changes?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Only the wrapped word becomes italic.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The whole sentence becomes italic.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The wrapped word starts on a new line.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Only the wrapped word becomes italic.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 134815,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What are the <code>&lt;strong&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/strong&gt;</code> tags for?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">They define text as important</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">They make the text unbreakable by line break</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">They define text as important.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The <code>strong</code> element marks text as important and makes it bold.</p><p>You write <code>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warning&lt;/strong&gt;: wet floor.&lt;/p&gt;</code>.</p><p>Which text is marked important and appears bold?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Warning</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Warning: wet floor.</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>: wet floor.</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>Warning</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 134816,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Give emphasis to the album title by adding the opening and closing emphasis tags.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" I just listened to \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Abbey Road\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" for the first time.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;em&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Use matching tags to give only the album title emphasis so it renders in italics.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" I just listened to \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Abbey Road\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" for the first time.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;strong&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/strong&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;br&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;em&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 134819,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add a line break to the address between <em>Mimo</em> and <em>Vienna, Austria</em>, such that <em>Mimo</em> appears on one line and <em>Vienna, Austria</em> appears below it.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Mimo \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Vienna, Austria \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/br&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Put each part of the address on its own line.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Mimo \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Karlsplatz 1 \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Vienna, Austria \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;rb&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;p&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/p&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;br&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 3",
            "id": 134817,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Give emphasis to the words in the second sentence.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My friends get annoyed when I post in italics. \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"I guess it's a\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bit too right-leaning for them.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"106\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;em&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Give emphasis to the whole second sentence only.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My friends get annoyed when I post in italics. \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"I guess it's a\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bit too right-leaning for them.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;strong&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/strong&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;br&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;em&gt;</code>, followed by <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 4",
            "id": 134818,
            "contentType": "interactive",
